  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Given,</p><p>circle&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt><mfenced><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>y</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p>With centre <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><mfrac><mn>1</mn><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></mfrac><mo>,</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></math>&nbsp;and radius <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>1</mn></math>.</p><p>Since&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8736;</mo><mi>B</mi><mi>A</mi><mi>C</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mi>&#960;</mi><mn>2</mn></mfrac></math>, so&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>B</mi><mi>C</mi></math>&nbsp;will act as diameter,</p><p><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/b47f8de6-4fef-46de-85d2-3e827c2542cf-image.png\" style=\"width: 163px; height: 130px;\" /></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>B</mi><mi>C</mi><mo>=</mo></math>diameter<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>&#160;</mo></math>&nbsp;(given)</p><p>So,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>A</mi><mi>C</mi><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mi>B</mi><msup><mi>C</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mi>A</mi><msup><mi>B</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></msqrt><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></math>&nbsp;and&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></math></p><p>Now,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#9651;</mo><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi><mi>C</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi><mo>&#183;</mo><mi>A</mi><mi>C</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></math>&nbsp;&nbsp;</p>",
